[{"speaker":"","text":"猛烈的射精甚至让我的视野一阵晕眩。","art":{"background":"a2031","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"自慰的时候可从没这样过。","art":{"background":"a2031","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「呼……呼……呼……呼……」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"芳乃弓起的身子也重新落回了被褥上。","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"她瘫在那里，茫然地看着自己的身体和我的阳具。","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我们……做爱了啊……」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「是啊，做爱了」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「呼……呼……太好了，成功了……」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「太舒服了」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「我也是。虽然疼……但是很开心，很舒服……很幸福」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也很幸福」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「喜欢……我真的很喜欢你」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「我也是」","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"我直接抱住芳乃的身体，把脸靠过去。","art":{"background":"a2033","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「芳乃……」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"芳乃","text":"「啊，唔……啾，啾，啾唔……啾噜，啾，啾啾」","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"},{"speaker":"","text":"我们相拥在被褥之上，沉醉于亲吻之中，甚至都忘记了时间。","art":{"background":"a119","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-2"}]